## Original Content
La titular de Defensa ha defendido la españolidad de Ceuta y Melilla, así como la labor del CNI

## Summary
Robles, the Minister of Defense, stated that the CNI informed the government the day before the assault on Ceuta, contradicting Marlaska's statements. She defended the Spanish sovereignty over Ceuta and Melilla and praised the CNI's work.

## Key Points
- Robles claimed the CNI alerted the government prior to the Ceuta assault.
- This contradicts Marlaska's position or statements.
- Robles defended the Spanishness of Ceuta and Melilla.
- Robles highlighted the effective labor of the CNI.


